{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55807","headline":"题所居 · 黄子棱","name":"题所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山木笏尚初官，未老金鱼是等闲。\n世上几多名将相，门前谁有此溪山。\n市楼晚日红高下，客艇春波绿往还。\n人过小桥频指点，全家都在画图间。\n（见《嘉靖建阳县志》卷七、周亮工《闽小纪》卷二）（按：《四库全书》本《福建通志》卷七七题作《望考亭》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄子棱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}